# Enemy composition 6 — three Anchors two tiles apart, and something that puts you between them.
# Terrain and placement share one grid, so the board is what it looks like.
#   .  open        #  wall        O  pit        ^  spikes      H  high ground
#   A  Player A deploy slot       B  Player B deploy slot
#   any other letter = an enemy declared by a 'spawn' line below

id: ec-06-the-vice
number: 306
name: The Vice
description: An Anchor line with two gaps in it, and a Grappler behind you that keeps putting people in the gaps. Push 1 cannot open a gap; splitting the party can.

spawn n = Anchor
spawn g = Grappler
spawn l = Lobber

roster a: Vanguard, Wardbearer
roster b: Archer, Threadcaster

board:
  ..l..BB
  .....BB
  .......
  Hn.n.nH
  .......
  A.^.^..
  AA...g.
